WEBVTT

00:33:57.618 --> 00:34:00.414
CA: On the right, they might also say,

00:34:00.438 --> 00:34:04.131
"Don't talk to me about this community
being the sort of solution, the center.

00:34:04.155 --> 00:34:06.548
Our whole point is about community.

00:34:06.572 --> 00:34:11.061
We are a community that
has not been listened to properly.

00:34:11.085 --> 00:34:13.800
We believe passionately in, you know,

00:34:13.824 --> 00:34:20.821
the America that we remember
and love and miss and whatever,

00:34:20.845 --> 00:34:23.185
and it's all about community."

00:34:23.209 --> 00:34:25.990
So what are they missing?

00:34:26.014 --> 00:34:29.836
DB: Yeah, well, I would say --
say, evangelical Christians on the right.

00:34:29.860 --> 00:34:32.612
They have community,
but they also have a siege mentality,